title
  Ultimate Creature Encounter Generator

output
  [narrative]

// =========================
// NARRATIVE ENGINE
// =========================

narrative
  [para_intro]<br><br>[para_encounter]<br><br>[para_action]<br><br>[legendary_block][para_outro]

para_intro
  You arrive in [biome], where the air feels [adjective] and the ground shifts beneath your feet. The atmosphere carries hints of [seasonal_event], and every shadow seems alive with possibility.
  As you step into [biome], a [adjective] breeze brushes past you. The land feels ancient, shaped by countless stories whispered under [seasonal_event].
  The journey brings you deep into [biome], where strange sounds echo between the terrain. Something about the place feels [adjective] today.

para_encounter
  It is not long before you notice [creature.a] [location]. Its [personality_trait] manner makes it seem more aware of you than you are of it.
  From the corner of your eye, you spot [creature.a] lingering [location], watching you with a [adjective] and [personality_trait] gaze.
  A sudden movement draws your attention: [creature.a] emerges [location], moving with a strangely [personality_trait] confidence against the backdrop of [biome].

para_action
  The [creature] pauses, then begins to [action]. For a moment, the world narrows to just you, the [creature], and the rhythm of [biome].
  Unsure whether to approach or retreat, you simply watch as the [creature] [action] [location], as if performing for an unseen audience.
  You take a cautious step closer. The [creature] reacts by trying to [verb] something near a {import:common-noun}, clearly preoccupied with its own [personality_trait] agenda.

legendary_block
  [para_legendary]<br><br>
  ""
  ""

para_legendary
  A sudden stillness falls over [biome]. The air hums with power as [legendary_creature_title] appears in the distance, surrounded by [legendary_event]. For a heartbeat, you feel as if the entire world is holding its breath.
  Stories you once dismissed as myths rush back to you when [legendary_creature_title] steps out from behind [common-noun], its presence bending the light around it. This is the kind of moment that becomes a legend of its own.
  You sense that you have stumbled into something far greater than a simple encounter. [legendary_creature_title] moves with slow, deliberate grace, and [legendary_event] unfolds around it like a living prophecy.

para_outro
  As the light shifts and [seasonal_mod], you realize it is time to move on. The memory of this encounter in [biome] will linger long after your footprints fade.
  Eventually, the [creature] slips away, leaving only disturbed ground and a faint echo behind. You continue through [biome], wondering what else might be watching.
  With one last glance over your shoulder, you leave [location] behind. The path ahead twists deeper into [biome], and the story of today becomes just one more secret of this place. Somewhere in your mind, you quietly [branch_choice].

// =========================
// CREATURES
// =========================

creature
  [animal]
  [mythical_creature]

animal
  pig
  cow
  chicken
  zebra
  crayfish
  jellyfish^0.5
  worm^2
  otter
  goose
  alpaca
  salamander
  beetle^1.5

mythical_creature
  dragon
  phoenix
  kelpie
  kitsune
  basilisk
  griffin
  fae sprite
  shadow wolf
  storm serpent
  moss giant

// =========================
// PERSONALITY TRAITS
// =========================

personality_trait
  cautious
  curious
  arrogant
  playful
  solemn
  mischievous
  wary
  gentle
  unpredictable
  proud
  distant
  strangely friendly

// =========================
// LEGENDARY ENCOUNTERS
// =========================

legendary_creature_title
  an ancient dragon of forgotten storms
  a phoenix older than the forest itself
  a veiled titan woven from moonlight
  a serpent that coils around the horizon
  a guardian spirit of the first dawn
  a colossal stag crowned with living stars

legendary_event
  swirling embers that refuse to fade
  a ring of silent lightning frozen in the sky
  a chorus of distant voices speaking in unison
  shadows that move against the light
  a rain of glowing petals that never touch the ground
  a slow ripple in reality, like water disturbed by an unseen hand

branch_choice
  promise to remember every detail
  decide to never speak of this to anyone
  wonder if any of it was real
  vow to return here someday
  quietly thank whatever fate led you here
  choose to treat this as the beginning of a larger journey

// =========================
// DESCRIPTORS
// =========================

adjective
  small
  big
  cute
  sneaky
  unusual
  helpful
  mean
  majestic
  chaotic
  mysterious
  slippery
  energetic

adjective2
  adorable
  terrifying
  misunderstood
  unpredictable
  surprisingly polite
  extremely dramatic

// =========================
// VERBS & ACTIONS
// =========================

verb
  pat
  befriend
  help
  observe
  chase
  study
  avoid
  photograph
  interrogate
  summon
  banish

action
  dances awkwardly
  vanishes suddenly
  emits a strange humming noise
  rolls around dramatically
  steals your lunch
  stares into the void
  performs a ritual
  digs a suspicious hole
  levitates slowly
  argues with itself

// =========================
// LOCATIONS & BIOMES
// =========================

location
  on the island
  in the valley
  around here
  in the clearing
  over there near the rocks
  under this strange structure
  near the old {import:common-noun}
  beside the glowing {import:common-noun}
  deep within the forest
  atop the ancient ruins
  beneath the crystal arch

biome
  the frozen tundra
  the dense jungle
  the misty swamp
  the crystal caverns
  the volcanic ridge
  the enchanted forest
  the desert of echoes
  the storm plains
  the coral labyrinth

// =========================
// COMPARISONS & ODDITIES
// =========================

comparison_noun
  {import:common-noun}
  {import:common-noun}
  [weird_object]

weird_object
  glowing rock
  suspicious sandwich
  enchanted bucket
  confused robot
  tiny spaceship

// =========================
// SEASONAL FLAVOR
// =========================

seasonal_mod
  today
  this season
  lately
  during the solstice
  under the harvest moon
  after the first snowfall

seasonal_event
  the winter solstice
  the spring bloom
  the summer blaze
  the autumn dusk
  the eclipse night
  the comet passing